    "A latch survives daemon restarts. `mooringctl exit retry` clears it, and so does a configuration change such as `exit record-carrier --replace`; the exit then probes afresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锁存在守护进程重启后仍然保留。`mooringctl exit retry` 会解除它，配置变更（例如 `exit record-carrier --replace`）也会；解除后出口会重新探测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A line from mooringctl could not be read: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
