    "IPv4 on the M7's network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M7 网络中的 IPv4"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the SIM or the carrier's address pool changed, record the new prefixes (`mooringctl exit record-carrier --replace`, then `mooringctl node apply` for each node). If the M7 left the mobile line for its Wi-Fi or Ethernet offload, turn the offload off. Then run `mooringctl exit retry`: the exit probes afresh and starts if the address passes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果换了 SIM 卡，或者运营商换了地址段：登记新的地址段（`mooringctl exit record-carrier --replace`，再对每个节点运行 `mooringctl node apply`）。如果是 M7 改走了 Wi-Fi 或以太网卸载，把卸载关掉。然后运行 `mooringctl exit retry`：出口会重新探测，地址通过就恢复服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the SIM was changed, both records are the old SIM's. Record them for the new one: `docs/runbooks/swap-day.md`, section 2, steps 3 to 6 (`mooringctl exit disable`, `exit observe`, `exit record-carrier --replace`, `sim set-anchor`, `node apply` for each node, `exit enable`). If both records are right for the SIM now in the M7, `mooringctl sim accept-network` in Terminal takes %@ as the one on record and changes neither record. This notice ends once either is recorded with other values, once that command takes the network, or once the M7 reports %@ again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果换过 SIM 卡，这两项登记仍是旧卡的，需要为新卡重新登记：`docs/runbooks/swap-day.md` 第 2 节第 3 至 6 步（`mooringctl exit disable`、`exit observe`、`exit record-carrier --replace`、`sim set-anchor`、对每个节点运行 `node apply`、`exit enable`）。如果这两项登记对 M7 里现在这张卡都是对的，在终端里运行 `mooringctl sim accept-network`，它会把“%1$@”记为登记时的网络，两项登记都不改动。任何一项登记成别的值之后、这条命令记下这个网络之后，或者 M7 重新报告“%2$@”之后，这条提醒就会消失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the recorded carrier prefixes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在登记的运营商地址段内"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interface": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
