    "On %@ this cycle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本周期在 %@ 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On battery the exit is degraded and the Mac may sleep; it drains the nodes before it does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用电池时出口处于降级状态，Mac 可能睡眠；睡眠前会先排空各节点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On record": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登记时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On record is the network the M7 reported when `mooringctl sim accept-network` took it at the operator's word; the daemon compares every later poll with it. The carrier check and the billing cycle were not recorded again for it. The daemon reads the SIM's name and the network's codes only, so two SIMs of one carrier look alike.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“登记时”是指在终端里运行 `mooringctl sim accept-network`、由操作者认可时 M7 报告的网络；守护进程把之后每次轮询的结果与它比较。运营商地址检查和计费周期当时没有为它重新登记。守护进程只读 SIM 卡的名称和网络代码，所以同一运营商的两张卡看起来一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On record is what the M7 reported at the first poll that found it attached after the carrier check or the billing cycle was last recorded; the daemon compares every later poll with it. The daemon reads the SIM's name and the network's codes only, so two SIMs of one carrier look alike.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“登记时”是指上一次登记运营商地址检查或计费周期之后，第一次见到 M7 连上移动网络的那次轮询里 M7 报告的内容；守护进程把之后每次轮询的结果与它比较。守护进程只读 SIM 卡的名称和网络代码，所以同一运营商的两张卡看起来一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: %@. The exit needs these off; turn them off in the M7's web interface.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已开启：%@。出口要求这些保持关闭，请在 M7 的网页管理界面里关掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: %@; the exit needs these off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已开启：%@；出口要求这些保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One sample per poll of the M7, kept by the daemon for the newest 90 days (`mooringctl router history` prints them).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次轮询 M7 留下一条采样，守护进程保留最新的 90 天（`mooringctl router history` 可打印它们）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the count is read; read messages in the M7's web interface.": {
