    "Since %@ the M7 reports %@. The carrier check and the billing cycle on record go with %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自 %1$@ 起，M7 报告的是“%2$@”。已登记的运营商地址检查和计费周期对应的是“%3$@”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Since %@ the M7 reports %@. The carrier check and the billing cycle on record go with %@: either the SIM was changed for another of the same name, or its carrier moved it to another network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自 %1$@ 起，M7 报告的是“%2$@”。已登记的运营商地址检查和计费周期对应的是“%3$@”：要么换了一张同名的 SIM 卡，要么运营商把这张卡转到了另一个网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Since %@.": {
