    "Traffic left by %@'s own address, not by this line. %@ was told to halt and stays halted after the latch is cleared: find the cause before `mooringctl exit retry`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "流量是从 %1$@ 自己的地址出去的，没有走这条线路。已要求 %2$@ 停机，解除锁存后它仍然停机：先查明原因，再运行 `mooringctl exit retry`。"
          }
