    "Wi-Fi radio": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi 射频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With paired probes, users' traffic must leave by the address the direct probes around it see. If the carrier hands this line changing addresses, record the check again with `--pairing unpaired` (`mooringctl exit record-carrier --replace`, then `mooringctl node apply` for each node). Then run `mooringctl exit retry`: the exit probes afresh and starts if the address passes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对方式下，用户流量的出口地址必须和前后两次直连探测看到的一致。如果运营商给这条线路的地址会变，用 `--pairing unpaired` 重新登记检查（`mooringctl exit record-carrier --replace`，再对每个节点运行 `mooringctl node apply`）。然后运行 `mooringctl exit retry`：出口会重新探测，地址通过就恢复服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the default thresholds, saturated means uplink use of at least %lld %%, or latency inflated by %lld ms or more, for %lld minutes; every user shares the uplink.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按默认阈值，上行使用率至少 %1$lld %%，或延迟增加 %2$lld 毫秒以上，并持续 %3$lld 分钟，即为饱和；所有用户共用这条上行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing watch state failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入监视状态失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing watch state failed (errno %d)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入监视状态失败（errno %d）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Xray": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Your own networks, declared with `mooringctl exit allow-network`, and CFM's tunnel keep the exit serving; every exit connection stays bound to the M7.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 `mooringctl exit allow-network` 声明的自有网络和 CFM 的隧道不影响出口继续服务；每个出口连接仍绑定在 M7 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`mooringctl exit enable`, `disable` and `retry` change it from Terminal; the console only shows it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在终端里用 `mooringctl exit enable`、`disable` 和 `retry` 修改；控制台只负责显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`mooringctl node new` and `node adopt` add the first node.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 `mooringctl node new` 和 `node adopt` 添加第一个节点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`mooringctl sim set-plan`, `set-stop` and `set-anchor` change them from Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在终端里用 `mooringctl sim set-plan`、`set-stop` 和 `set-anchor` 修改。"
